  "issue": {
    "author": "krassowski",
    "body_normalized": "## Description\n\nThe tab order is wrong in staatusbar for some items\n\n## Reproduce\n\n1. Pull https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/17591\n2. Tab to kernel item in status bar\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e72830d6-3ea7-40b8-b994-fb3845da3921)\n3. Press Tab, see focus goes to bell icon\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a51a1dcf-8f30-4677-8025-a6aafc9c2f17)\n4. Press Tab, see focus goes to lines and columns item\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d2f446af-86b7-45e9-bccc-e01cf3739ad1)\n\n\n## Expected behavior\n\nIt goes to lines & columns first then to the bell icon\n\n## Context\n\n- JupyterLab version: 4.4.x",
    "body_raw": "## Description\n\nThe tab order is wrong in staatusbar for some items\n\n## Reproduce\n\n1. Pull https://github.com/jupyterlab/jupyterlab/pull/17591\n2. Tab to kernel item in status bar \n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e72830d6-3ea7-40b8-b994-fb3845da3921)\n3. Press Tab, see focus goes to bell icon\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a51a1dcf-8f30-4677-8025-a6aafc9c2f17)\n4. Press Tab, see focus goes to lines and columns item\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d2f446af-86b7-45e9-bccc-e01cf3739ad1)\n\n\n## Expected behavior\n\nIt goes to lines & columns first then to the bell icon\n\n## Context\n\n- JupyterLab version: 4.4.x",
    "body_sha256": "50864fdde6cb265eff5f6b1473ea49e9630fa889956c46bcaf4448ac49954e56",
